'''Raw psykk bat (6)''' is obtained by from catching [[psykk bat]]s within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Raw psykk bats require level 90 in Hunter to catch and grant the player 29 [[experience]] when caught.

They are cooked with a [[Cooking]] level of 90 to produce [[psykk bat (6)]], granting 28 experience in Cooking.

